# Legacy CARGO_TARGET_DIR from the retired cargo-apple/xcodegen build
# script (see crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/) — some tooling in
# there still redirects cargo's output here instead of the workspace's
# shared /target above.
crates/client/target/

# iOS build (CADisplayLink, default since crates/client/src/cadisplaylink/
# replaced the winit-driven app — see crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/
# for the retired approach, kept for reference/rollback). The Xcode project
# copies the real libclient.a in as iOS/libs/debug/libbevy_in_app.a for
# local testing — a large build artifact, not source.
crates/client/gen/apple/iOS/libs/
crates/client/gen/apple/iOS/bevy_in_iOS.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
crates/client/gen/apple/iOS/bevy_in_iOS.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
# xcodebuild's own DerivedData-style output dir when built with `build/`
# as the derived-data root (e.g. `xcodebuild ... build` run directly from
# iOS/) — same "large build artifact, not source" reasoning as libs/ above.
crates/client/gen/apple/iOS/build/

# Retired winit-driven iOS build — see crates/client/gen/apple/ (its
# replacement) for why. Kept for reference/rollback, not actively built, so
# its own build artifacts are still worth ignoring if anyone does build it.
crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/target/
crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
crates/client/gen/apple_winit_legacy/Sources/*-apple-ios*/

# CADisplayLink probe experiment sandbox (see
# crates/client/src/cadisplaylink/) — a standalone crate under experiments/
# with its own target/ (a separate cargo workspace, not a member of the
# root one), kept around for future CPU/FPS comparisons.
experiments/cadisplaylink_probe/target/

# First meshy.ai prop test (docs/PROP_IMPORT_CHECKLIST.md) — 116MB
# High Detail export, not yet Remeshed down to game-usable size. Not
# committed on purpose (huge binary would live in git history forever
# even after replacement); re-add this ignore removal once a properly
# sized (Smart Topology or Remeshed) version replaces it.
crates/client/assets/props/car_sedan/mesh/car_sedan.glb
# Same story: 140MB Meshy High Detail export of the cargo van (8192px
# textures), local-only source for car_van_light.glb (gltfpack + resized
# textures, see PROP_IMPORT_CHECKLIST.md).
crates/client/assets/props/car_van/mesh/car_van.glb
# Same story: 105MB Meshy High Detail export of the pickup truck (8192px
# texture), local-only source for car_pickup_light.glb.
crates/client/assets/props/car_pickup/mesh/car_pickup.glb
# Same story: 66MB Meshy Text-to-3D export of the VF3-inspired car (8192px
# texture), local-only source for car_vf3_light.glb.
crates/client/assets/props/car_vf3/mesh/car_vf3.glb
# Same story: 12 more Text-to-3D exports (High Detail + 8K texture,
# Resize+Origin:Bottom already baked in at download time), local-only
# sources for their own *_light.glb.
crates/client/assets/props/car_suv/mesh/car_suv.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_hatchback/mesh/car_hatchback.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_sports/mesh/car_sports.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_taxi/mesh/car_taxi.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_police/mesh/car_police.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_ambulance/mesh/car_ambulance.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_delivery/mesh/car_delivery.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_towtruck/mesh/car_towtruck.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_wagon/mesh/car_wagon.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_motorcycle/mesh/car_motorcycle.glb
crates/client/assets/props/car_muscle/mesh/car_muscle.glb
